            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "YannikHinteregger"
            },
            "body": "Hi @usberkeley, I coordinated with @NickLucche on Slack about C4 from #48633. Based on that I added a `transfer_id` to the NIXL push connector in #59758 \r\n\r\nThe router sets it on the prefill and the decode request of one dispatch, so it's a deterministic pairing signal. I'd suggest using it for the heartbeats too\r\n\r\nI don't know if you'd rather build on top of #59758 now or wait until it merges. Please ping me if you need a review.",
